From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: akram-composio <akram@composio.dev>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:25:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] web: dress the web app in Kimono's paper, ink and seals
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Why: with only the logo and accent changed, Photos still looked like Immich
(cool greys, pills, Google Sans, black dark mode). It must feel like the same
product as the Kimono Portal: Kata, as defined by kimono/docs/design-system.md
and packages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css.

How: one unlayered stylesheet, web/src/kimono.css, imported from app.css right
after @immich/ui's theme. Tailwind v4 keeps theme variables and utilities in
cascade layers, so plain :root custom properties and rules in an unlayered file
win without touching components. Plus three tiny data-attribute hooks.

What must survive upstream changes:
- Paper and ink. Tailwind's neutral/gray/zinc/slate/stone scales (and therefore
  @immich/ui's light-*/dark-* scales, built on neutral) are one warm ramp from
  paper #fffdf8 to urushi #1d1417; --color-white/black are paper/plum-black.
  @immich/ui's --immich-ui-light/dark/gray/muted/default-border and Immich's
  legacy --immich-* RGB triplets follow. Light (paper: sheet #fbf7ef, ground
  #f7f1e8, fold #ebe2d3, hair #ddd0bf, ink #24221f) is the default; .dark is a
  plum-black urushi room (#1d1417 / #2a1d22, paper-toned type), never grey.
  app.html's pre-paint html.light/html.dark colours match.
- Colour roles. Primary is Photos' deep accent #482f74 (pale #e2dcf0, accent
  #8d7fb5; dark mode uses the pale ramp). Danger is suō #a84d63, success moss,
  warning wood, info plum. No blues or Immich greens.
- Type. Sans is Zen Maru Gothic (--font-sans); Shippori Mincho names things:
  @immich/ui <Heading>, page titles (#user-page-header), album titles. Fonts are
  served from /fonts/kimono/ (copied by repatches branding/web/install.sh).
- Corners and depth. --radius-* are 1px (controls) / 2px (surfaces). Shadow
  utilities become a 1px plum hairline; backdrop blur is off. Control bars are
  flat planks, not capsules.
- 判 Seals. @immich/ui Buttons with text are carved blocks: 2px corners, a 2px
  base (inset bottom shadow), a carved inner ring on inked faces, press = sink
  1px. Filled = inked in the accent; filled-secondary and outline = quiet seal
  (fold paper, hair base, no ring); danger = rose wash, inked on hover; ghost =
  a word, unless Immich gave it its own surface, then a quiet seal. Icon-only
  buttons are square-cut. Hook: the kimonoBrand Vite plugin adds
  data-k="seal"|"icon", data-k-variant, data-k-color to @immich/ui's
  internal/Button.svelte.
- Sidebar. No right-hand pills; the chosen room is a hover-paper row with a 3px
  marker in Photos' colour (hook: data-k-nav on @immich/ui NavbarItem).
- 紐 The cord: under the top bar (#dashboard-navbar), 2px plum over 1px sakura,
  as under every Kimono header (inverted tones in dark).
- Portraits without a picture: the initial in plum Mincho on fold paper
  (data-k-avatar on Immich's UserAvatar and @immich/ui's Avatar), not a random
  Immich colour disc.
- Reduced motion: seals don't animate.

