+/*
+ * Kimono Photos: Kimono's 型 Kata look for the Immich web app, applied at the root.
+ *
+ * Paper grounds, ink text, plum display type, flat surfaces with hairlines, and seals
+ * (carved hanko blocks) instead of pill buttons. Light paper is the default; dark is a
+ * plum-black urushi room, never Immich's grey. Photos' own colour (#8d7fb5 / deep
+ * #482f74 / pale #e2dcf0) is the primary: the bloom, primary seals, focus and the
+ * selected marker.
+ *
+ * Everything here is UNLAYERED on purpose: Tailwind's @theme variables and utilities
+ * live in cascade layers, so a plain :root custom property or rule here wins over them
+ * without touching components. Hooks used:
+ *  - Tailwind theme variables (--color-neutral/gray/..., --color-white/black, --radius-*,
+ *    --font-sans), read at runtime by every utility class.
+ *  - @immich/ui's theme variables (--immich-ui-*) and Immich's legacy --immich-* triplets.
+ *  - data attributes added to @immich/ui's Button, Heading and NavbarItem by the
+ *    kimonoBrand Vite plugin (web/vite.config.ts): [data-k="seal"|"icon"],
+ *    [data-k-variant], [data-k-color], [data-k-heading], [data-k-nav].
+ * Fonts are copied to /fonts/kimono/ by repatches' branding/web/install.sh.
+ * Source of truth: kimono/docs/design-system.md and packages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css.
+ */
